      "parameters": {
        "content": "AI Agent adalah otak sales.\nSupabase = memory/source of truth.\nTools hanya READ-ONLY: Products, FAQ, Promotions + Think.\n\nFallback:\nSlot 1 Flash \u2192 Slot 2 Flash \u2192 Slot 3 Flash \u2192 Flash-Lite.\nJika semua gagal: AI job RETRY/FAILED, inbound tetap aman.\nWEB CONTROLS: read canonical config, ACK version, then execute. Daily configuration lives in My Control. Secrets and graph wiring remain in n8n. No blind retries after transport uncertainty.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 640
      },
